# DESK15 run D -- *Remove* on the card run A wrote.  README.TXT carries the
# trash icon; selecting it, opening `ADINSWIN` and pressing Remove must
# `app_free` the `#N ... README.TXT@` node, after which the file falls back to
# the generic `#F FF 07 @ *.*@` document icon.
#   README.TXT (515,218) from run B's window dump (the reopened `#W` geometry).
#   Options title (196,8); "Install icon..." = entry 1 (200,43).
#   IW_REMV click (366,335) from the dialog-probe dump.
100 parkbr
300 move 600 460
2500 mark A_IDLE
2800 move 515 218
3100 down
3103 up
3400 move 600 460
4200 mark B_SEL
4500 move 196 8
5200 mark C_OPTIONS
5500 move 200 43
5800 down
5803 up
6100 move 600 460
7200 mark D_DIALOG
7500 move 366 335
7800 down
7803 up
8100 move 600 460
9300 mark E_REMOVED
